<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu edges up to 4.632 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu edges up to 4.632 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu edged up to 4.632 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange from 4.633 on Thursday.</p>
<p>				     Sept 20		 Sept 19</p>
<p>    Lei per dollar	     4.632		   4.633</p>
<p>    Volume traded ($)	  25,000		  20,000</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
